TQL EVAL (1, 1, '1s') clamp_max(dynamic_scalar_input, scalar(dynamic_scalar_bound{p="missing"} @ 0));

+---------------------+----------------------------+---+
| ts                  | clamp_max(val,scalar(val)) | k |
+---------------------+----------------------------+---+
| 1970-01-01T00:00:01 | NaN                        | a |
| 1970-01-01T00:00:01 | NaN                        | b |
